# StoryWalker AI - Environment Configuration
#
# NOTE: This is an open-source project. All API keys are entered through
# the in-app Settings modal at runtime - no environment variables required!
#
# Simply run the app and click the Settings (gear) icon to enter your keys.
# Your keys are stored locally in your browser and never sent to any server
# except the respective API providers (Google, OpenRouter, ElevenLabs).
#
# This file exists only for Docker configuration and is not required for
# running the application.
